    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just being tired though. it's like, what's the point of it all? i see people at their absolute worst, losing everything, and i’m just there as a witness to the misery. it feels like i'm just delaying the inevitable. it's like there's no actual meaning to the struggle, just more struggle. i'm just so done with the noise of it all.",
