    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know. i've talked to people. i've done the therapy shit. it doesn't change the fact that the world is just a meat grinder. sometimes i'm sitting in my car in the hospital parking lot at 4am and i just think... if i just stopped, if i just wasn't part of this whole machine anymore, it would be so quiet. it would finally be quiet. it feels like the only way to actually get any peace is to just... let the weight win.",
